+/* Host test of nvkmd_nvrm_recover.h (the pure part of rebuilding a channel). Not built by meson. From this directory:
+ *   cc -std=c11 -O1 -g -Wall -Wextra -Werror -I. nvkmd_nvrm_recover_test.c -o /tmp/nvkmd_nvrm_recover_test && /tmp/nvkmd_nvrm_recover_test
+ * (add -fsanitize=address,undefined where the compiler has a runtime for them). Exit 0 = every arm passed.
+ * The plan and fill arms run against a model of a context's ring driven by the rules of nvrm_gsub_submit: flushes of
+ * 1 to 40 GPFIFO entries, up to 63 in flight, the GPFIFO wrapping, entries written after the last doorbell or not. The
+ * controls at the end feed the checkers a damaged result and must see it refused. */
